# hipify output and build products. `setup.py --variant rocm` writes a *_hip.*
# / *.hip twin next to every source file, plus the extension in-tree. A
# `git add -A` after a build otherwise sweeps ~9k lines of generated code and a
# 15MB .so into the commit.
*_hip.cpp
*_hip.hpp
*_hip.cuh
*.hip
